.Dd August 3, 2026
.Dt MICROINIT.SERVICES.ENABLED-OVERRIDE.JSON 5
.Os "BigFred OS"
.Sh NAME
.Nm microinit.services.enabled-override.json
.Nd persistent enabled flag overrides for microinit
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Pa /data/etc/microinit.services.enabled-override.json
.Sh DESCRIPTION
JSON object mapping service name to boolean.
Loaded after
.Xr microinit.json 5
and overrides each service's
.Cm enabled
field.
Missing keys keep the value from the main config.
.Pp
Created lazily on the first
.Nm microinit Cm enable
or
.Nm microinit Cm disable
command.
Writes are atomic (temp file + rename).
.Pp
.Nm microinit Cm enable Ar name
sets the override to true and starts the service.
.Nm microinit Cm disable Ar name
sets false and stops the service.
.Sh EXAMPLES
.Bd -literal
{
  "dropbear": false,
  "grafana": true
}
.Ed
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr microinit 8 ,
.Xr microinit.json 5
